# box-keys (M7): a's box (330, 408.5, 107 x 32 at 1440 x 900) from the keyboard. A click opens its
# field and Esc closes it, handing the focus back to the box with the ring, in every engine (plain
# Tab reaches it at different stops in WebKit and Chromium). Then → nudges 0.01 (1.01), Shift+↑ 0.1
# (1.11), ← 0.01 (1.10), each a direct change; Backspace resets (1.00); Enter opens the field with
# its text selected; Esc closes it.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 383 424
wait 16
key Escape
wait 16
shot focused
key ArrowRight
key ArrowUp shift
key ArrowLeft
wait 16
shot nudged
key Backspace
wait 1000
shot reset
key Enter
wait 16
shot open
key Escape
wait 16
shot closed
